# TeX Live packages CI installs (zauguin/install-texlive, cached between
# runs). tlmgr resolves only the dependencies declared in the TeX Live
# database, which are incomplete, so this list must be transitively
# complete: every package whose files xelatex opens while rendering.
#
# Derived by rendering every tests/fixtures/*.json with `xelatex -recorder`
# and mapping each file in the .fls records to its package via
# tlpkg/texlive.tlpdb. Re-derive the same way after adding a
# \RequirePackage — a missing package fails CI loudly, never silently.
scheme-basic
xetex

booktabs
enumitem
environ
fontspec
lastpage
listings
parskip
pdfcol
pgf
setspace
siunitx
tcolorbox
tikzfill
titlesec
trimspaces
ulem
xcolor
